cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PyCVDRisk: cardiovascular risk scores from across the world, verified, in Python"
abstract: >-
  Python implementations of published cardiovascular risk scores (SCORE2, PREVENT, QRISK3,
  Framingham, the WHO charts and others) under one vectorised API, each implemented from its
  original publication and verified against it and, where one exists, an independent reference
  implementation.
type: software
authors:
